msgstr "缓冲区的固有高度（像素）。赋予新值会清空缓冲图像并重置上下文状态。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLCanvasElement.xml
msgid ""
"The intrinsic backing width in pixels. Assigning a new value clears the backing image and resets "
"its context state."
msgstr "缓冲区的固有宽度（像素）。赋予新值会清空缓冲图像并重置上下文状态。"

