#. doc_classes/HTMLCanvasRenderingContext2D.xml
msgid "The width used by stroke operations. Values must be positive."
msgstr "描边操作使用的线宽。必须大于零。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLCanvasRenderingContext2D.xml
