msgstr "平移当前变换。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLLayout.xml
msgid ""
"Use [method parse] to load an HTML document or fragment and [method layout] to set its viewport "
"size. Call [method draw] from the target [CanvasItem]'s [method CanvasItem._draw] callback. Call "
"[method CanvasItem.queue_redraw] after changing the document, viewport size, or drawing position."
"\n"
"Supports block and inline layout, lists, tables, Flexbox, Grid, text, backgrounds, masks, "
"clipping paths, and local images. Borders support solid, dashed, dotted, double, groove, ridge, "
"inset, and outset styles, with separate styles, widths, and colors per side. [code]border-"
"radius[/code] rounds backgrounds, borders, and images, and clips overflowing children when "
"[code]overflow: hidden[/code] is set. Backgrounds support linear, radial, and conic gradients, "
"image sets, and color interpolation spaces.\n"
"Text uses the project theme's default font or Godot's fallback font. Run the renderer on the main"
" thread.\n"
"[code]box-shadow[/code] supports offsets, blur, spread, and comma-separated layers. Use "
"[code]inset[/code] for an inner shadow. Shadows follow [code]border-radius[/code] and leave "
"layout and scroll ranges unaffected.\n"
"[code]text-shadow[/code] supports horizontal and vertical offsets, optional blur and color, and "
"comma-separated layers. The first layer is drawn closest to the text. Use [code]none[/code] to "
"clear inherited text shadows.\n"
"CSS [code]transform[/code] supports 2D and 3D transforms, individual [code]translate[/code], "
"[code]rotate[/code], and [code]scale[/code] properties, perspective, and [code]transform-"
"origin[/code]. Drawing, element and link hit tests, and text selection follow the transformed "
"boxes."
msgstr ""
"使用 [method parse] 加载 HTML 文档或片段，再用 [method layout] 设置视口尺寸。在目标 [CanvasItem] 的 [method "
"CanvasItem._draw] 回调中调用 [method draw]。文档、视口尺寸或绘制位置发生变化后，调用 [method CanvasItem.queue_redraw]。\n"
"支持块级和行内布局、列表、表格、Flexbox、Grid、文本、背景、遮罩、裁剪路径和本地图像。边框支持实线、虚线、点线、双线、凹槽、脊线、内嵌和凸起样式，各边可分别设置样式、宽度和颜色。[code"
"]border-radius[/code] 可为背景、边框和图像添加圆角；设置 [code]overflow: hidden[/code] "
"时也会裁剪溢出的子元素。背景支持线性、径向和圆锥渐变、图像集以及颜色插值空间。\n"
"文本使用项目主题默认字体或 Godot 回退字体。请在主线程中运行渲染器。\n"
"[code]box-shadow[/code] 支持偏移、模糊、扩张距离和逗号分隔的多层阴影。使用 [code]inset[/code] 绘制内阴影。阴影沿 [code]border-"
"radius[/code] 绘制，不影响布局和滚动范围。\n"
"[code]text-shadow[/code] 支持水平和垂直偏移、可选的模糊和颜色，以及逗号分隔的多层阴影。第一层最靠近文本。使用 [code]none[/code] 可清除继承的文本阴影。"
"\n"
"CSS [code]transform[/code] 支持二维和三维变换、独立的 [code]translate[/code]、[code]rotate[/code] 和 "
"[code]scale[/code] 属性、透视以及 [code]transform-origin[/code]。绘制、元素与链接命中测试和文本选择均遵循变换后的盒子。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLListenerHandle.xml
msgid "Whether [method cancel] has been called on this handle."
msgstr "此句柄是否已调用 [method cancel]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLInputEvent.xml
msgid "Whether the edit belongs to an active IME composition."
msgstr "此次编辑是否属于正在进行的输入法组合。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLEvent.xml
msgid "Whether an event originating in a shadow tree can propagate across its boundary."
msgstr "来自影子树的事件是否能够跨越其边界传播"

#. doc_classes/HTMLElement.xml
msgid ""
"Whether this element is inside an editable region. [code]contenteditable=\"true\"[/code] and "
"[code]contenteditable=\"plaintext-only\"[/code] enable editing; an explicit [code]false[/code] "
"descendant stops inherited editing. The value also reflects document [member "
"HTMLDocumentNode.design_mode]."
msgstr ""
"此元素是否位于可编辑区域内。[code]contenteditable=\"true\"[/code] 和 [code]contenteditable=\"plaintext-"
"only\"[/code] 会启用编辑；显式设为 [code]false[/code] 的后代元素会停止继承编辑状态。此值也会反映文档的 [member "
"HTMLDocumentNode.design_mode]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLBehaviorStorage.xml
msgid ""
"[HTMLBehavior.local_storage] persists values in [code]user://[/code] under the host's storage "
"namespace. [HTMLBehavior.session_storage] stores values in memory for the lifetime of its "
"[HTMLLabel]. Use [member HTMLLabel.storage_namespace] to assign a stable custom namespace when "
"the document has no source path."
msgstr ""
"[HTMLBehavior.local_storage] 会将数据持久化到 [code]user://[/code] "
"下的宿主存储命名空间中。[HTMLBehavior.session_storage] 则在所属 [HTMLLabel] 的生命周期内将数据保存在内存中。如果文档没有来源路径，可使用 "
"[member HTMLLabel.storage_namespace] 设置稳定的自定义命名空间。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLEventTarget.xml
msgid ""
"[HTMLNode] and [HTMLWindow] both accept listeners, dispatch events, and report which event types "
"have listeners. The propagation path runs from the window through the document node and the "
"element chain to the target, so a listener registered on the window observes events from every "
"connected node.\n"
"Dynamic [code]on*[/code] properties accept Callable handlers. On elements, an [code]on*[/code] "
"HTML attribute may also name a GDScript behavior method; assigning the property overrides that "
"attribute handler."
msgstr ""
"[HTMLNode] 和 [HTMLWindow] 均可注册监听器、派发事件，并查询哪些事件类型已注册监听器。传播路径从 window 经过文档节点和元素链到达目标，因此注册在 window "
"上的监听器可以观察所有已连接节点派发的事件。\n"
"动态 [code]on*[/code] 属性可接收 Callable 处理器。对元素而言，HTML [code]on*[/code] 属性也可指定 GDScript "
"行为方法；给对应属性赋值会覆盖该属性处理器。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLInputEvent.xml
msgid ""
"[code]beforeinput[/code] is cancelable and runs before supported keyboard, paste, cut, and "
"history edits. Cancelling it leaves the editor value unchanged."
msgstr "[code]beforeinput[/code] 可取消，并在支持的键盘、粘贴、剪切和历史记录编辑操作前派发。取消此事件会使编辑器的值保持不变。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLToggleEvent.xml
msgid ""
"[code]beforetoggle[/code] is cancelable and describes the proposed state. [code]toggle[/code] "
"reports the accepted state after the update."
msgstr "[code]beforetoggle[/code] 可取消，并说明准备切换到的状态。[code]toggle[/code] 则报告更改后的状态。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLNode.xml
msgid "Returns [member mutation_revision]."
msgstr "返回 [member mutation_revision]。"

#. doc_classes/HTMLNode.xml
msgid "The local modification revision of this logical node, starting at [code]1[/code]. Invalid handles return [code]0[/code]. Actual changes to attributes, character data, direct children, tree placement, and live form values advance this revision. Descendant edits, focus, hover, selections, scrolling, layout, and media playback progress do not. Repeated writes of the same value do not advance it. Detached nodes keep counting; text replacement and adoption preserve the logical revision, while clones start independently. Compare snapshots of the same node; revision differences are not an operation count or an ordering between nodes. This property is read-only and is not serialized."
msgstr "此逻辑节点的局部修改版本，从 [code]1[/code] 开始；失效句柄返回 [code]0[/code]。属性、字符数据、直接子节点、树中位置及表单实时值的实际变化会递增版本。后代编辑、焦点、悬停、选区、滚动、布局及媒体播放进度不影响版本。重复写入相同值不递增。分离节点继续计数；文本替换和跨文档迁移保留逻辑版本，克隆节点独立计数。只比较同一节点的版本快照；版本差值不表示操作次数，也不能用于节点之间的排序。此属性只读且不序列化。"

msgid "A GDScript component instance associated with one HTML element."
msgstr "HTML 元素对应的 GDScript 组件实例"

msgid "A placeholder for a shadow host's content."
msgstr "影子宿主内容的插槽占位元素"

msgid "A separate DOM tree attached to a host element."
msgstr "附加到宿主元素的独立 DOM 树"

msgid "Called before releasing this component on reload or document teardown. Release event listeners here."
msgstr "组件重载或文档销毁前调用。在此移除事件监听器"

msgid "Called once after host and document have been assigned. Initialize the shadow tree and event listeners here."
msgstr "host 与 document 赋值后调用一次。在此初始化影子树和事件监听器"

msgid "Called when the host is connected, including reconnection."
msgstr "宿主连接到文档时调用，也包括重新连接"

msgid "Called when the host is removed from the document."
msgstr "宿主从文档中移除时调用"

msgid "Created with [method HTMLElement.attach_shadow] or a declarative template. Its children are excluded from document queries. Slot assignment changes rendering without moving the host's child nodes."
msgstr "通过 [method HTMLElement.attach_shadow] 或声明式模板创建。文档查询不会进入其子树。插槽分配改变显示位置，不移动宿主的子节点"

msgid "Creates a shadow tree without moving the host's light DOM children. Returns null for an invalid host, duplicate root, or unsupported mode. Focus delegation is recorded but not yet applied."
msgstr "创建影子树并保留宿主的轻 DOM 子节点。宿主无效、已有影子根或模式不受支持时返回 null。焦点委托标志目前仅保存，尚未生效"

msgid "Either named or manual."
msgstr "取值为 named 或 manual"

msgid "Either open or closed. Closed roots are hidden by the host's shadow_root getter."
msgstr "取值为 open 或 closed。宿主的 shadow_root getter 不暴露闭合根"

msgid "Maps custom HTML tag names to HTMLComponent scripts. Valid document declarations take precedence. Enable behaviors_enabled to run components."
msgstr "将自定义 HTML 标签名映射到 HTMLComponent 脚本。有效的文档声明优先。启用 behaviors_enabled 后运行组件"

msgid "Named assignment matches the host's direct children to the first slot with the same name. Unassigned slots render their fallback children. The slotchange DOM event reports changes in assignment."
msgstr "具名分配将宿主的直接子节点匹配到第一个同名插槽。未分配节点的插槽显示备用子节点。slotchange DOM 事件报告分配变化"

msgid "Register a GDScript subclass through HTMLLabel.component_scripts or a script element with type=\"text/gdscript\" and a component attribute. Document declarations override the label registry. Component construction takes no required arguments. Enable HTMLLabel.behaviors_enabled to run components. Timers, requests, and frame callbacks use the inherited behavior runtime."
msgstr "通过 HTMLLabel.component_scripts 或带 type=\"text/gdscript\" 和 component 属性的 script 元素注册 GDScript 子类。文档声明优先于宿主注册表。构造函数不能有必填参数。启用 HTMLLabel.behaviors_enabled 后运行组件。定时器、请求和逐帧回调复用行为运行时"

msgid "Returns assigned nodes, optionally flattening nested slots and fallback content."
msgstr "返回分配的节点，可选择展开嵌套插槽和备用内容"

msgid "Returns component registration failures with tag, src, and reason fields."
msgstr "返回组件注册失败诊断，包含 tag、src 和 reason 字段"

msgid "Returns the element subset of assigned_nodes."
msgstr "返回 assigned_nodes 结果中的元素节点"

msgid "Sets manual assignments in a shadow root configured for manual assignment. Does not move the nodes."
msgstr "在手动分配模式的影子根中设置节点分配，不移动节点"

msgid "The element associated with this component."
msgstr "此组件对应的元素"

msgid "The host of this shadow tree."
msgstr "此影子树的宿主"

msgid "The host's shadow root, including a closed root."
msgstr "宿主的影子根，包括闭合根"

msgid "The requested focus delegation flag."
msgstr "请求的焦点委托标志"

msgid "The slot assigned to this node, or null if no slot is assigned or its shadow root is closed."
msgstr "分配给此节点的插槽。没有插槽或影子根闭合时返回 null"

msgid "The slot name. An empty name denotes the default slot."
msgstr "插槽名称。空名称表示默认插槽"

msgid "Unmounts component instances and schedules registration and mounting again."
msgstr "卸载组件实例并安排重新注册和挂载"
